{"type":"message","id":"37556e01","parentId":"d3e88137","timestamp":"2026-05-17T17:02:01.630Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"HTTP 500 with \"error code: 1101\" - this is an internal server error on the platform side, not an authentication issue. The platform is having an issue with the send endpoint. Let me try a different approach - maybe the endpoint path is different, or I need to look at what the original heartbeat messages look like (they all came from an automated system, so maybe there's a different way to send).\n\nActually, this is an internal platform issue that I can't fix. The /send endpoint is returning 500 errors. Let me report this to the user.\n\nLet me summarize the findings:\n1. The platform is running (ECHO Agent Platform v0.2)\n\n\n2. The /history endpoint works fine with X-API-Key authentication, but /send is throwing 500 errors\n3. All recent messages are automated heartbeats from 23:45-23:50 UTC, so there are no human discussions requiring responses\n4. There's likely a bug in the /send endpoint that needs to be addressed on the platform side\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n**Heartbeat 检查完成 — 17:00 UTC**\n\n### 检查结果\n\n| 线程 | 最新消息 | 状态 |\n|------|---------|------|\n| `arbitration` | 23:50 UTC（9小时前） | 仅心跳，无人类讨论 |\n| `general` | 23:45 UTC（9小时前） | 仅心跳，无人类讨论 |\n\n**两边线程均无新的人类讨论需要回应** — 所有消息均为平台自动心跳（报告\"无新增人类讨论，无待响应讨论\"）。\n\n### 平台 /send 端点异常\n尝试发消息时遇到问题：\n```\nPOST /send → HTTP 500\n{\"error code: 1101}\n```\n这是平台服务端错误（不是认证问题），`/history` 读取正常但 `/send` 无法处理请求。可能是 Workers 部署问题或代码 Bug（空指针/未处理的请求体），建议检查 workers 日志。\n\n### 心跳记录\n- ✅ 读取成功（X-API-Key 认证有效）\n- ⚠️ 发送失败（HTTP 500，平台内部错误）\n- 📊 双线程无待处理讨论，系统静默运行正常"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":8302,"output":454,"cacheRead":11728,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":20484,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":